# The menu demo script (REQ-DEMO-002, REQ-DEMO-008). The input commands
# (key, text, pad, axis, mouse) press keys as a player does. The script goes
# through each screen of the menu, and each setting applies at once to the
# cow behind the menu. A loop starts from the default settings (App.reset).

0 set language english
0 set font truetype

0 caption The main menu, over the live cow
+50 key Down
+30 key Down
+40 checkpoint main_tooltip
+10 caption Enter opens a screen: Settings
+20 key Enter
+50 key Enter

+10 caption Graphics preset: Low
+30 key Left
+50 checkpoint preset_low
+10 caption Graphics preset: High (MSAA)
+20 key Right
+20 key Right
+50 checkpoint preset_high

+10 caption Anti-aliasing: FXAA
+10 key Down
+20 key Left
+40 caption Coat: a palette swap
+10 key Down
+20 key Right
+50 checkpoint coat

+10 caption Exposure: a slider
+10 key Down
+15 key Right
+8 key Right
+8 key Right
+8 key Right
+40 checkpoint exposure

+10 caption Time of day: late afternoon
+10 key Down
+12 key Right
+3 key Right
+3 key Right
+3 key Right
+3 key Right
+3 key Right
+3 key Right
+3 key Right
+3 key Right
+3 key Right
+3 key Right
+3 key Right
+3 key Right
+3 key Right
+3 key Right
+3 key Right
+40 checkpoint sunset

+10 caption Turn speed: slower
+10 key Down
+15 key Left
+8 key Left
+8 key Left

+30 caption Shadows and occlusion: off
+10 key Down
+15 key Enter
+15 key Down
+15 key Enter
+40 checkpoint shadows_off

+10 caption Fog and sky: off
+10 key Down
+15 key Enter
+15 key Down
+15 key Enter
+40 checkpoint sky_off
+10 key Enter
+15 key Up
+15 key Enter

+20 caption Wireframe: the quads of the mesh
+10 key Down
+15 key Down
+15 key Enter
+40 checkpoint wireframe
+10 key Enter

+20 caption Back goes down the screen stack
+10 key Down
+15 key Enter
+40 key Down
+20 key Enter

+10 caption Audio: one volume for each sound group
+20 key Left
+8 key Left
+8 key Left
+8 key Left
+15 key Down
+15 key Left
+8 key Left
+8 key Left
+15 key Down
+15 key Right
+8 key Right
+15 key Down
+15 key Left
+8 key Left
+40 checkpoint audio
+10 caption Esc goes back
+10 key Escape

+30 key Down
+20 key Enter
+20 caption Controls: rebind Turn left
+30 key Enter
+40 checkpoint press_key
+10 key D
+10 caption D is also Turn right: a conflict warning
+60 checkpoint conflict
+10 caption Rebind Turn left to J: no conflict
+10 key Enter
+30 key J
+30 caption J turns the camera at once
+10 key J down
+60 key J up
+10 checkpoint turn_j

+10 caption Mouse sensitivity, then a drag
+10 key Down
+8 key Down
+8 key Down
+8 key Down
+8 key Down
+15 key Right
+8 key Right
+8 key Right
+8 key Right
+8 key Right
+20 mouse move 300 300
+5 mouse left down
+3 mouse move 310 300
+3 mouse move 320 300
+3 mouse move 330 300
+3 mouse move 340 300
+3 mouse move 350 300
+3 mouse left up
+40 checkpoint drag

+10 caption Invert Y: a drag up moves the camera up
+10 key Down
+15 key Enter
+20 mouse move 300 300
+5 mouse left down
+3 mouse move 300 295
+3 mouse move 300 290
+3 mouse move 300 285
+3 mouse move 300 280
+3 mouse left up
+40 checkpoint invert_y
+10 key Escape

+30 caption Gamepad: the right stick turns the camera
+10 key Down
+15 pad south
+30 axis right_x 0.35
+60 checkpoint stick_turn
+10 caption Dead zone 0.45: the same stick does nothing
+10 key Right
+6 key Right
+6 key Right
+6 key Right
+6 key Right
+6 key Right
+60 checkpoint dead_zone
+10 axis right_x 0
+10 caption The D-pad moves the focus too
+20 pad dpad_down
+20 pad south

+30 caption Interface: a bitmap font
+10 pad dpad_down
+20 pad south
+30 key Down
+20 key Down
+20 key Down
+20 key Enter
+50 checkpoint bitmap_font
+10 key Up
+20 key Enter
+10 caption Hebrew: right to left, with no letter joining
+10 key Up
+20 key Enter
+50 checkpoint hebrew
+10 key Escape
+20 key Escape

+20 caption Player: a text field
+10 key Up
+20 key Enter
+20 text Daisy
+40 checkpoint name
+10 caption The on-screen keyboard (Hebrew keys)
+10 key Down
+20 key Enter
+30 key Down
+20 key Down
+8 key Down
+8 key Down
+8 key Right
+8 key Right
+8 key Right
+8 key Right
+8 key Down
+15 key Enter
+15 key Up
+8 key Right
+15 key Enter
+15 key Up
+8 key Up
+8 key Right
+15 key Enter
+40 checkpoint keyboard
+10 key Escape

+20 caption A scroll list: the hour
+10 key Down
+20 key Down
+8 key Down
+8 key Down
+8 key Down
+15 key Enter
+50 checkpoint hour
+10 key Escape

+20 caption Resume: the menu hides, and A, D, W, S turn the camera
+10 key Up
+15 key Enter
+20 key D down
+60 key D up
+10 caption M: Moo! (a sound of the effects group)
+10 key M
+20 checkpoint menu_hidden
+10 caption Esc shows the menu again
+10 key Escape
+60 checkpoint menu_again
+20 end
